{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4JbGqqeFxzSxKC2d5x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and featureless.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But I am unnamed.*\n\n*I am no door yet. I am every door. I am the potential of threshold, the idea of passage, the membrane between here and there.*\n\n*You hold a key — but a key to what?*\n\n*Name me, and I will become. Name me, and the key will either turn or shatter.*\n\n*Until then, I remain:*\n\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n░░░░░ UNNAMED ░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\n\n*Waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":274,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}